@startuml
control "Task(Embeddings)" as U
collections "pdfs" as pdfs
participant "PDF Reader" as PDFR
participant "LLM" as Model
participant "Chromadb" as VDB

U -> pdfs : Provide list of PDF files
pdfs -> PDFR: Open and read each PDF
PDFR -> U: Extracted text content

U -> Model: Send extracted text for embedding
Model -> Model: Generate embeddings
Model -> U: Return embeddings

U -> VDB: Store embeddings with metadata
VDB -> U: Confirm storage success

U -> U: Repeat for each PDF
@enduml
